# ADP what exactly is in the industry

A company that protects the river will eventually have to be put into a competitive pattern to verify. This one pulls the angle away -- who's the opponent of ADP? Where do they bite ADP, where they won't?

The market itself: the global HCM (human capital management) software market reached **58.7 billion in 2024,** growth from the same year **11.7%**. This is a market that is still expanding rapidly.

But this market has one key feature:** it is highly dispersed but head concentrated**. The former 10 major producers held **45.6%** of the market share, with the remaining 54% divided by hundreds of small-scale producers.

(Source: AppsRun TheWorld HCM Market Report)

ADP is uniquely placed - it ranks first in the sub-area (municipality ratio approximately **10%**) ** in the broader context of the HCM market**, but only in the top (municipality rate about **5%**).

This positioning determines the ADP strategy:** to hold the core pay position while expanding to HCM worldwide**.

